# Project Context

## Stack
- Next.js 16 (App Router) deployed on Vercel
- Webflow exported HTML/CSS/JS converted to Next.js components
- Webflow CSS kept for converted pages (no Tailwind)

## Project Type
- **Nside Template** — agency/corporate site converted from Webflow
- Pages: home, intro, services, projects, contact, search

## Critical Rules
- Images: use `next/image` with `width`, `height`, and `alt`
- Fonts: Inter + Open Sans via `next/font/google`
- Only load Webflow JS (`next/script strategy="lazyOnload"`) when actual Webflow interactions are present
- Clean Webflow tracking attributes and badges
- CSS url() paths: use `/fonts/` and `/images/` (public folder)

## File Naming
- Components: PascalCase (`HeroSection.tsx`)
- Pages: lowercase (`app/projects/page.tsx`)
- Utilities: camelCase (`formatDate.ts`)
